{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026EIWHEdv4ev1792666380.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>過去數十年，體重可達200公斤的綠海龜(又稱綠蠵龜，學名：Chelonia mydas)一直處於瀕危邊緣。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"greenturtle.cover.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/202634GtUe9Bi71792666406.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>雖然受惠世界各地的保育措施，綠海龜於2025年已脫離「瀕危」行列，惟牠們仍會因為誤陷漁網、棲息地遭塑膠垃圾污染、海岸開發破壞等人為因素而受到威脅。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"greenturtle.1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026KRI69iEGnp1792666423.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>近日在越南中部理山島，當地居民救起一隻被漁網纏住的綠海龜，牠的右前鰭因長時間纏繞嚴重受傷。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"greenturtle.2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Kn4Xx3BdUC1792666438.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>這隻綠海龜經過六日治療及監測後，已恢復過來。居民把綠海龜帶到理山島附近的受保護海域，將牠放歸大自然。片段可見，綠海龜回到海洋之後，隨即暢泳。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T00:44:22.611867+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":244,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T00:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T02:58:44.813597+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T00:38:22.250619+00:00","content_hash":"9dc5b3f38664a3eafa36e92fc1703539f1ba65084bf88a3c0c1c15164c26d682","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T00:44:22.611867+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}